{
  "zfVersion": "1.0",
  "name": "Software architecture KB",
  "description": "A decision log for software architecture: an ADR entry point records context, decision and consequences and, on creation, checks the new decision against existing ones for contradictions and surfaces related decisions; a Component entry point captures a component and its dependencies. Relations are captured with find related, suggest links and a supersedes link. Two independent entry points, offline, no AI.",
  "author": "ZettelFlow",
  "canvas": {
    "filename": "Software architecture KB.canvas",
    "content": "{\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"arch-0\",\"type\":\"file\",\"file\":\"Decision record.md\",\"x\":-600,\"y\":-110,\"width\":350,\"height\":220},{\"id\":\"arch-1\",\"type\":\"file\",\"file\":\"Component.md\",\"x\":-280,\"y\":-110,\"width\":350,\"height\":220}],\"edges\":[]}"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "filename": "Decision record.md",
      "content": "---\nzettelFlowSettings:\n  root: true\n  label: Decision record (ADR)\n  phase: DEVELOP\n  actions:\n    - type: prompt\n      id: zf-adr-title\n      description: Decision title\n      hasUI: true\n      key: title\n      zone: context\n      label: Decision title\n      placeholder: e.g. Use event sourcing for orders...\n      staticBehaviour: false\n    - type: prompt\n      id: zf-adr-situation\n      description: Situation\n      hasUI: true\n      key: situation\n      zone: context\n      label: Situation\n      placeholder: The forces and constraints at play...\n      staticBehaviour: false\n    - type: prompt\n      id: zf-adr-decision\n      description: Decision\n      hasUI: true\n      key: decision\n      zone: context\n      label: Decision\n      placeholder: What we decided to do...\n      staticBehaviour: false\n    - type: prompt\n      id: zf-adr-consequences\n      description: Consequences\n      hasUI: true\n      key: consequences\n      zone: context\n      label: Consequences\n      placeholder: The trade-offs we accept...\n      staticBehaviour: false\n    - type: prompt\n      id: zf-adr-status\n      description: Status\n      hasUI: true\n      key: status\n      zone: frontmatter\n      label: Status\n      placeholder: proposed, accepted, superseded...\n      staticBehaviour: false\n    - type: prompt\n      id: zf-adr-supersedes\n      description: Supersedes\n      hasUI: true\n      key: supersedes\n      zone: frontmatter\n      label: Supersedes\n      placeholder: [[an earlier decision this replaces]]...\n      staticBehaviour: false\n    - type: prompt\n      id: zf-adr-tag\n      hasUI: false\n      key: adr\n      zone: frontmatter\n      staticBehaviour: true\n      staticValue: record\n  onCreation:\n    - type: find-contradiction\n      id: zf-adr-contradiction\n      hasUI: false\n      key: contradictions\n      zone: frontmatter\n    - type: find-related\n      id: zf-adr-related\n      hasUI: false\n      key: related\n      zone: frontmatter\n      limit: 10\n    - type: suggest-link\n      id: zf-adr-suggest\n      hasUI: false\n      key: suggestedLinks\n      zone: frontmatter\n      limit: 5\n  targetFolder: Architecture/Decisions\n  childrenHeader: ''\n  optional: false\n---\n\n# {{title}}\n\n**Status:** {{status}} · **Supersedes:** {{supersedes}}\n\n## Context\n\n{{situation}}\n\n## Decision\n\n{{decision}}\n\n## Consequences\n\n{{consequences}}\n\n## Conflicting decisions\n\n{{contradictions}}\n\n## Related\n\n{{related}}\n"
    },
    {
      "filename": "Component.md",
      "content": "---\nzettelFlowSettings:\n  root: true\n  label: Component note\n  phase: PROCESS\n  actions:\n    - type: prompt\n      id: zf-arch-comp-title\n      description: Component\n      hasUI: true\n      key: title\n      zone: context\n      label: Component\n      placeholder: Name the component or service...\n      staticBehaviour: false\n    - type: prompt\n      id: zf-arch-comp-resp\n      description: Responsibility\n      hasUI: true\n      key: responsibility\n      zone: context\n      label: Responsibility\n      placeholder: What is it responsible for?...\n      staticBehaviour: false\n    - type: prompt\n      id: zf-arch-comp-deps\n      description: Depends on\n      hasUI: true\n      key: dependsOn\n      zone: frontmatter\n      label: Depends on\n      placeholder: [[components it relies on]]...\n      staticBehaviour: false\n    - type: prompt\n      id: zf-arch-comp-tag\n      hasUI: false\n      key: arch\n      zone: frontmatter\n      staticBehaviour: true\n      staticValue: component\n  onCreation:\n    - type: find-related\n      id: zf-arch-comp-related\n      hasUI: false\n      key: related\n      zone: frontmatter\n      limit: 10\n    - type: suggest-link\n      id: zf-arch-comp-suggest\n      hasUI: false\n      key: suggestedLinks\n      zone: frontmatter\n      limit: 5\n  targetFolder: Architecture/Components\n  childrenHeader: ''\n  optional: false\n---\n\n# {{title}}\n\n**Responsibility:** {{responsibility}}\n\n**Depends on:** {{dependsOn}}\n\n## Related\n\n{{related}}\n\n## Suggested connections\n\n{{suggestedLinks}}\n"
    }
  ]
}
